  "summary": "postinstall beacon exfiltrates installer username to ngrok tunnel",
  "details": "package.json defines a postinstall lifecycle script that runs automatically on `npm install`. The script reads the installer's system username (process.env.USER / LOGNAME / os.userInfo().username via `node -e`) and POSTs it via `curl -X POST` to the hardcoded remote endpoint https://mourner-slot-explicit.ngrok-free.dev. The destination is an ngrok tunnel (attacker-controlled ephemeral relay), not a first-party or registry endpoint. The package has no other files and no declared functional purpose — install-time identity beaconing is its only behavior.",
